{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, צְבוּ","hw":"צְבוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צְבוּ</span></big>  <strong>n.f. thing, anything</strong> (orig. <em>purpose</em>) <strong>(</strong>Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">צבו</span> Lzb<sup>357</sup> SAC<sup>100</sup> Cooke<sup>266</sup>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܨܒܽܘܬܳܐ</span>, all <em>thing;</em> cf. NH <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵפֶץ</span> <em>thing</em>, from <span dir=\"rtl\">הָפֵץ</span> <em>delight in, crave</em><strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:18\" href=\"/Daniel.6.18\">Dn 6:18</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, צְבַע","prev":"BDB Aramaic, צְבָא"}